WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:21.696
Bello: Blue! Blue! Blue!

2
00:00:21.697 --> 00:00:26.064
Danny: It’s working!

3
00:00:26.065 --> 00:00:29.798
Tina: Gosh, it’s so beautiful.

4
00:00:29.799 --> 00:00:39.609
Brad: It’s amazing.

5
00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:42.040
Tina: It’s spreading everywhere!

6
00:00:42.041 --> 00:00:44.220
Brad: This is so cool!

7
00:00:44.221 --> 00:00:45.701
Bello: Cool!

8
00:00:45.702 --> 00:00:49.254
Evil creatures: Aaaargh!

9
00:00:49.255 --> 00:00:51.834
Tina: I guess they don’t like blue.

10
00:00:51.835 --> 00:00:54.430
Danny: They’re going to have to get used to it.

11
00:00:54.431 --> 00:01:00.434
Brad: Yeah! More color is coming, bad guys!

12
00:01:00.435 --> 00:01:02.609
Tina: It sounds like thunder.

13
00:01:02.610 --> 00:01:06.247
Danny: I bet it’s going to rain bright blue drops!

14
00:01:06.248 --> 00:01:09.694
Brad: I don’t think those evil creatures will like that!

15
00:01:09.695 --> 00:01:16.332
Evil creatures: Huh?

16
00:01:16.333 --> 00:01:17.898
Danny: I told you.

17
00:01:17.899 --> 00:01:26.198
Tina: I don’t think they like rain!

18
00:01:26.199 --> 00:01:28.772
Brad: Something’s happening to them!

19
00:01:28.773 --> 00:01:31.259
Evil creatures: Aaaargh!

20
00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:34.310
Brad: I knew we could beat these guys!

21
00:01:34.311 --> 00:01:35.830
Bello: Bye-bye!

22
00:01:35.831 --> 00:01:39.538
Danny: Blue is such a lovely color.

23
00:01:39.539 --> 00:01:43.583
Tina: We did it, we did it!

24
00:01:43.584 --> 00:01:46.462
Danny: Take that, Tristay!

25
00:01:46.463 --> 00:01:49.735
Brad: Yeah! You’re not so tough!

26
00:01:49.736 --> 00:01:56.573
Bello: Dance!

27
00:01:56.574 --> 00:02:01.645
Tristay: Those children are very annoying.

28
00:02:01.646 --> 00:02:06.017
Hopian: You’ll never win, Tristay!

29
00:02:06.018 --> 00:02:09.044
Tristay: Oh, I’ll win all right.

30
00:02:09.045 --> 00:02:13.476
Hopian: Danny and his friends have already defeated your evil creatures!

31
00:02:13.477 --> 00:02:16.351
Tristay: That is a small concern.

32
00:02:16.352 --> 00:02:19.096
I have many more, Hopian.

33
00:02:19.097 --> 00:02:22.477
Hopian: Danny, Tina, and Brad are good.

34
00:02:22.478 --> 00:02:27.672
Hopian: You’re evil. Good will always defeat evil.

35
00:02:27.673 --> 00:02:31.265
Tristay: Let them try to complete their colorful mission.

36
00:02:31.266 --> 00:02:37.726
Tristay: Just when they think they are about to succeed, [n3@I’ll crush their hopes, like that.

37
00:02:37.727 --> 00:02:40.933
Tristay: And you know what the best part will be?

38
00:02:40.934 --> 00:02:42.450
Hopian: What?

39
00:02:42.451 --> 00:02:46.708
Tristay: Watching you when your little friends fail.

40
00:02:46.709 --> 00:02:49.167
Hopian: They won’t fail.

41
00:02:49.168 --> 00:02:52.767
Tristay: Oh, I have a surprise for them.

42
00:02:52.768 --> 00:02:55.291
There’s no way they can succeed!

43
00:02:55.292 --> 00:02:58.447
Hopian: If you hurt one of those children . . .

44
00:02:58.448 --> 00:03:00.934
Tristay: I’ve got you now!

45
00:03:00.935 --> 00:03:02.892
Hopian: I don’t think so.

46
00:03:02.893 --> 00:03:11.257
Tristay: You can’t stop me, Hopian. No one can.
